1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,720
Hey—
Gun, are you drunk?

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:08,800
Yeah… look at him, he's wasted.
Who's this?

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,885
Oh, this is Gun's younger brother.
And this is P'Paeng.

4
00:00:12,909 --> 00:00:16,160
She's my friend—a private tutor,
and she's studying with Gun.

5
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,489
They're classmates right now.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,675
- Oh, hello. - Hello—so you're
Gun's younger brother? You're cute.

7
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:27,902
Can I flirt with you?
No.

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:36,120
Uh—I mean he's still young.
Let him focus on his studies.

9
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,440
Oof—Gun…

10
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:43,550
Gun, are you okay?
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm fine.

11
00:00:45,386 --> 00:00:47,399
What time is it?

12
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:53,600
Midnight.
Oh, right.

13
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,120
I'm fine, bro.

14
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:09,040
Damn it— Are you really okay?
Yeah.

15
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:27,040
Is something wrong?
Sir, you can't park here.

16
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:31,270
Why not? I saw the spot was empty.

17
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:36,294
This is private property.
Please move your car.

18
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:43,260
Come on, cut me some slack.

19
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:58,639
Don't make me use force.

20
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,439
Fine, I'll move it.
